t/pull/116751#pullrequestreview-3867245540","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116751","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-02-27T14:31:01Z"},{"id":3867994908,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7mjOsc","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"37f1e8b9f79ff763b64baa06b4c1c3fcc9428a74","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50084500?u=188e88b24d6994108226c9c94ad225775258d6ef&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Geometror","id":50084500,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMDg0NTAw","login":"Geometror","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116751#pullrequestreview-3867994908","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116751","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-02-27T16:55:12Z"},{"id":4329453069,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAg42DQ","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"f94a5e800db77aa882bfe83d226c2eda6fdfe5a7","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?u=a04daf8c4d579b733ac46d2e4d17324cca7870c0&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","login":"kleonc","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc"},"body":"Skimmed through, didn't check/analyze the usage in the changed Controls.\n\nThe currently used sorting is unstable, meaning the commands' ordering is not preserved even within the same `order+texture` spans. This is an issue for rendering commands relying on the command ordering like `CommandAnimationSlice`, `CommandClipIgnore`, `CommandTransform`.\n\nEither it should be changed to use stable sorting, or combining presorting with such commands should be made unsupported (docs + warnings/errors?).\n\n<details><summary>Example of how it breaks using CommandTransform</summary>\n<p>\n\n```gdscript\nextends Node2D\n\n@export var use_presort := false\n@export var t_speed := 8.0\n\nvar row_count := 1\nvar rows_max := 128\nvar t := 0.0\nfunc _process(delta: float) -> void:\n\tt += delta * t_speed\n\tif t >= 1.0:\n\t\trow_count = maxi(1, (row_count + 1) % rows_max)\n\t\tt = fmod(t, 1.0)\n\tqueue_redraw()\n\nfunc _draw() -> void:\n\tvar colors := PackedColorArray([\n\t\tColor.RED,\n\t\tColor.GREEN,\n\t\tColor.BLUE,\n\t\tColor.VIOLET,\n\t])\n\tvar s := get_viewport_rect().size\n\tvar cell_size := s / Vector2(colors.size(), row_count)\n\n\tvar ci := get_canvas_item()\n\tif use_presort:\n\t\tRenderingServer.canvas_item_set_presort_level(ci, 0)\n\tfor y: int in row_count:\n\t\tfor x: int in colors.size():\n\t\t\tvar color := colors[x]\n\t\t\tdraw_set_transform(Vector2(x, y) * cell_size)\n\t\t\tdraw_rect(Rect2(Vector2(), cell_size).grow(-1), color)\n\tif use_presort:\n\t\tRenderingServer.canvas_item_flush_presort(ci)\n```\n\n- `use_presort == false`:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3eba753e-8201-45d4-b295-99d5c05d0a87\n\n- `use_presort == true`:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6791be4b-e11f-46d8-8505-e96105177498\n\n</p>\n</details> ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116751#pullrequestreview-4329453069","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116751","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-05-20T14:36:08Z"},{"id":4332586823,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAj4HRw","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"277b38e258331a962f00c2fa644df447a6dc7dce","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected. Code looks good to me.\r\n\r\n## Benchmark\r\n\r\n<details open>\r\n\r\n<summary>PC specifications</summary>\r\n\r\n- **CPU:** AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D\r\n- **GPU:** NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090\r\n- **RAM:** 64 GB (2×32 GB DDR5-6000 CL30)\r\n- **SSD:** Solidigm P44 Pro 2 TB\r\n- **OS:** Linux (Fedora 43)\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nUsing a release export template (`production=yes lto=full`) and the MRP of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104537. When using that MRP, make sure to assign the custom font and export a PCK with **Include Text Server Data** enabled in the Project Settings, so that line breaking works as intended when running from a non-editor binary.\r\n\r\nRenderer | Before | After\r\n-|-|-\r\nMobile | 9027 FPS (0.11 mspf) | 15012 FPS (0.06 mspf)\r\nCompatibility | 3791 FPS (0.26 mspf) | 15709 FPS (0.06 mspf)\r\n\r\nI've also tested https://github.com/chairfull/GodotRichTextLabel2_Demo and rendering is still correct, with a smaller but still consistently reproducible performance boost. Performance on the startup tab at the default window size:\r\n\r\nRenderer | Before | After\r\n-|-|-\r\nMobile | 3326 FPS (0.30 mspf) | 3537 FPS (0.28 mspf)\r\nCompatibility | 2607 FPS (0.38 mspf) | 3295 FPS (0.30 mspf)","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116751#pullrequestreview-4332586823","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116751","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-05-20T22:07:14Z"}]